OL,3,GNEWSA'Clear message needed' over Mersey
OL,4,Aferry problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region's deputy mayor
OL,7,Fhas called on transport bosses to
OL,8,Fexplain why Mersey Ferries have not
OL,9,Fbeen running for nearly three weeks.
OL,11,FSpeaking on BBC Radio Merseyside's The
OL,12,FHot Seat, Graham Morgan said he would
OL,13,Fpress Merseytravel for an update about
OL,14,Fwhen passenger ferry services would
OL,15,Fresume on the river.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
