OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Clear message needed' over Mersey
OL,4,Aferry problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FMersey Ferries has said that one of its
OL,7,Fvessels, The Snowdrop, would be out of
OL,8,Faction for "several more weeks" because
OL,9,Fof an "ongoing mechanical issue with
OL,10,Fits engine", while its new #26m ferry,
OL,11,Fthe Royal Daffodil, has yet to start
OL,12,Fpassenger services despite having been
OL,13,Fofficially launched.
OL,15,FThe last passenger ferry service
OL,16,Foperated on 10 October.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
